  "description": "herald — the AegisBastion alert module (doc 05): sole notification egress (Ruling C7). Ingest AlertEvent v1 from *.alert bus subjects + REST, authz-context enforcement against gatekeeper JWKS (non-deferrable, §13.1), enrich/dedup/correlate/route/escalate, delivery to Slack/Teams/Splunk HEC/syslog/signed webhooks.",
